DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTSTAMP:20260928T183835Z
UID:c0e7525ec815947f77883f86@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A family experience. Enjoy the onsite amphitheater for event a
 ctivities and live music\, nearby accommodations\, campground games\, a co
 mmunal campfire and more! At 7\,000 ft. a limited field of riders will dis
 cover the challenges and gratification from riding awesome single track am
 ong a pine forest backdrop while witnessing the endless beauty of the fall
  season in the[Apache-Sitgreaves National Forests](http://www.fs.fed.us/r3
 /asnf/).\n\nEvent website: https://epicrides.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing
 : https://www.visitarizona.com/events/tour-of-the-white-mountains
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T183835Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/tour-of-the-white-mountains
