 ahuarita/PecanClassic10Kand5KRunWalk](https://runsignup.com/Race/AZ/Sahuar
 ita/PecanClassic10Kand5KRunWalk)\n\nEvent website: https://www.greenvalley
 pecan.com/5k-runs/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/
